  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1972
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前文或后文已经出现相关词、同义词或相反信息。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1973
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1974
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lexical recurrence：语篇会通过重复、同义和反",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1975
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义维持连贯。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1976
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “别只盯这个空，前后文可能已经把答案说过一遍。”",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1977
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这是完形最可靠的证据之一。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1978
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1979
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 遇到难空先画圈，不死磕。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1980
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 继续读后面两三句，找相同人物/物品/情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1981
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 圈同义词、反义词和代词。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1982
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 回填后整段顺读。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1983
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1984
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1985
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1986
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· problem ↔ difficulty",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1987
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· happy ↔ delighted",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1988
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· failed ↔ succeeded（反义转折）",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1989
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· the device ↔ it / the machine",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1990
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 答案与上下文形成清晰语义链。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1991
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 第一遍完全没线索就先跳，后文常会给“答案回声”。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1992
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1993
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前文说老人起初 hesitated，后文写在鼓励后“finally agreed”。中间空若考态度变化，可用这组反向线",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1994
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "索判断。",
      "sourcePage": 71,
      "sourceIndex": 1995
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 1996
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 认为每个空必须当场解决。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 1997
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只看前文不看后文。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 1998
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 1999
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 前后有没有同义/反义复现？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2000
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 回填后故事连贯吗？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2001
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2002
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2003
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2004
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 难空先留，后文可能会告诉你。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2005
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2007
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 前文“dog”，后文“animal”属于？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2008
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. happy vs sad 可形成？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2009
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. same word 出现就一定填它吗？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2010
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 复现线索可能在空后吗？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2011
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 难空先留的原因？",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2012
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 上下位复现；2. 反义/情绪对照；3. 不一定，要看句法和语义。；4. 可以。；5. 后文可能提供复现/解",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2013
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "释。",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2014
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C6 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C6”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 72,
      "sourceIndex": 2015
    }
